[{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0193","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0193.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-7251","title":"AnchorCMS error.log 数据库凭据信息泄漏漏洞","description":"AnchorCMS 0.12.3 版本的 config/error.php 文件存在敏感信息泄漏漏洞。该漏洞源于系统将错误日志以明文形式暴露在 errors.log URI 路径下，当 MySQL 数据库发生连接错误（如\"Too many connections\"）时，错误日志中会明文记录 MySQL 数据库的用户名和密码等认证凭据。远程攻击者无需任何身份认证即可通过直接访问 /errors.log 路径获取数据库凭据，进而可能导致数据库被完全控制。该漏洞影响 AnchorCMS 0.12.3 及更早版本，攻击复杂度低，危害严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-7251"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-19T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:52Z","remediation":"立即升级 AnchorCMS 至 0.12.7 或更高版本，该版本已修复 errors.log 暴露问题。如无法升级，在 Web 服务器（Nginx/Apache）配置中禁止访问 /errors.log 路径，例如 Nginx 添加 `location /errors.log { deny all; }`，并移除 config/error.php 中向 Web 可访问目录写入日志的配置。同时修改 MySQL 数据库密码以防已泄露的凭据被利用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154723/Anchor-CMS-0.12.3a-Information-Disclosure.html","http://www.andmp.com/2018/02/advisory-assigned-CVE-2018-7251-in-anchorcms.html","https://github.com/anchorcms/anchor-cms/issues/1247","https://github.com/anchorcms/anchor-cms/releases/tag/0.12.7","https://twitter.com/finnwea/status/965279233030393856","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47459","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7251.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-7251.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/be4eb5d180ce03ee7726c0a777ec4071d20eced1/2018/CVE-2018-7251.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-7251.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-7251.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-7251-3591.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-7251-3587.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-7251-3590.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-7251-3589.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/AnchorCMS/CVE-2018-7251.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/27584df20575115093a915d82c76b5107dd9d51e/cves/2018/7xxx/CVE-2018-7251.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0193.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0193.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0193.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0170","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0170.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-2392","title":"SAP Internet Graphics Server XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"SAP Internet Graphics Server（IGS）存在XML外部实体（XXE）注入漏洞。由于IGS在处理XMLCHART功能时未正确验证XML外部实体，远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标系统发送特制的XML请求触发该漏洞，导致IGS服务拒绝服务（不可用）。该漏洞影响SAP IGS 7.20、7.20EXT、7.45、7.49及7.53版本，CVSS评分7.5，危害等级高。SAP已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-2392"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-14T12:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:55:37Z","remediation":"立即应用 SAP Security Note 2525222 提供的补丁，将 SAP Internet Graphics Server (IGS) 升级至修复版本。SAP 已于 2018 年 2 月 Patch Day 发布该安全补丁，修复了 IGS 7.20、7.20EXT、7.45、7.49、7.53 版本中 XMLCHART 组件对 XML 外部实体（XXE）校验不严的问题。可通过 SAP Launchpad 下载补丁并参照 Note 说明进行安装。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 IGS XMLCHART 端口的非授权访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://blogs.sap.com/2018/02/13/sap-security-patch-day-february-2018/","https://launchpad.support.sap.com/#/notes/2525222","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2392.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2018/CVE-2018-2392.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2018/CVE-2018-2392.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2392.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-2392.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2392-3511.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2392-3508.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-2392-3510.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-2392/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2018-2392.py","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2018/CVE-2018-2392.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-2392.yaml","https://github.com/Vladimir-Ivanov-Git/sap_igs_xxe"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0170.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2018/EXP-AVE-2018-0170.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0170.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0189","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0189.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6910","title":"DedeCMS 5.7 路径信息泄露漏洞","description":"DedeCMS 5.7 版本存在路径信息泄露漏洞，远程攻击者无需身份认证即可通过直接访问 `include/downmix.inc.php` 或 `inc/inc_archives_functions.php` 等文件，触发 PHP 错误信息回显，从而获取服务器网站绝对路径等敏感信息。该漏洞利用条件极低，攻击者仅需发送 HTTP 请求即可完成探测，危害等级高，可能导致后续更深层次的攻击。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6910"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-13T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:26Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用已停止维护的 DedeCMS 5.7，迁移至其他受支持的 CMS 系统。如无法迁移，可采取以下缓解措施：1) 在 Nginx 中添加 `location ~ ^/(include|inc)/ { deny all; }` 或在 Apache 中添加 `<DirectoryMatch \"^/(include|inc)\"> Order Deny,Allow Deny from all </DirectoryMatch>` 禁止直接访问这两个目录下的 PHP 文件；2) 在 php.ini 中设置 `display_errors = Off` 和 `error_reporting = E_ALL & ~E_NOTICE & ~E_WARNING`，防止 PHP 错误信息泄露服务器路径；3) 将 `include/` 和 `inc/` 目录移出 Web 根目录，仅通过入口文件间接引用内部资源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/kongxin520/DedeCMS/blob/master/DedeCMS_5.7_Bug.md","https://kongxin.gitbook.io/dedecms-5-7-bug/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6910.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6910.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-6910.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6910.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-6910.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6910-3584.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6910-3585.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-6910-3586.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-6910-3582.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/dedecms-cve-2018-6910.yml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6910.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2018/POC-AVE-2018-0189.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0189.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0900","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6789","title":"Exim Exim 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Exim邮件服务器在SMTP监听器的base64d函数中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，攻击者可通过精心构造的邮件触发漏洞导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响Exim版本低于4.90.1的系统，攻击者无需身份验证即可远程利用，破坏完整性机密和可用性。漏洞源于对base64解码数据的处理不当，导致内存溢出。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6789"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-02-08T23:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:17Z","remediation":"立即升级 Exim 到 4.90.1 或更高版本，通过以下命令更新：apt-get install --upgrade exim4 或 yum update exim。安装完新版本后，重新加载服务以应用补丁。如无法立即更新，可通过修改 SMTP 配置文件禁用 base64 解码功能，或在防火墙中限制对邮件服务器的访问以降低风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2018/02/10/2","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162959/Exim-base64d-Buffer-Overflow.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2018/02/07/2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103049","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040461","https://devco.re/blog/2018/03/06/exim-off-by-one-RCE-exploiting-CVE-2018-6789-en/","https://exim.org/static/doc/security/CVE-2018-6789.txt","https://git.exim.org/exim.git/commit/cf3cd306062a08969c41a1cdd32c6855f1abecf1","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2018/02/msg00009.html","https://usn.ubuntu.com/3565-1/","https://www.debian.org/security/2018/dsa-4110","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44571/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/45671/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-6789","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44571","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/straightblast/My-PoC-Exploits/blob/781c953ee10d3ab7e116707e774df5e7289aaeee/CVE-2018-6789.py","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/by-cve/CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/d5d184c678eb47e0299d126ba2dc762c9b16b0fb/2018/CVE-2018-6789.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2018/CVE-2018-6789-beraphin_CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2018/CVE-2018-6789-c0llision_exim-vuln-poc.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/bed1b4e1019005da7f44bc035aba33656b38496b/data/2018/CVE-2018-6789-synacktiv_Exim-CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/BrianWGray/cmty-nexpose-checks/blob/13b1c2f4cca654217a136c8eec10f7f6e18f35b8/cmty-exim-cve-2018-6789.vck","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-6789.md","https://github.com/martinclauss/exim-rce-cve-2018-6789","https://github.com/synacktiv/Exim-CVE-2018-6789","https://github.com/beraphin/CVE-2018-6789","https://github.com/thistehneisen/CVE-2018-6789-Python3","https://github.com/c0llision/exim-vuln-poc"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0017","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0017.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0127","title":"思科 RV132W/RV134W系列VPN路由器Web管理界面信息泄露漏洞","description":"Cisco RV132W ADSL2+ Wireless-N VPN 路由器和 Cisco RV134W VDSL2 Wireless-AC VPN 路由器的 Web 管理界面存在身份验证缺失漏洞，部分包含敏感配置信息的页面未强制要求用户身份验证。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向受影响设备发送精心构造的 HTTP 请求，直接访问包含管理员密码等敏感配置参数的页面，从而获取设备管理权限。该漏洞影响 Cisco RV132W 和 RV134W 系列 VPN 路由器，CVSS 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，仅需发送恶意 HTTP 请求即可窃取管理员凭据并完全控制设备。Cisco 已发布安全公告 CSCvg92739 和 CSCvh60172 修复此漏洞，建议用户尽快升级固件版本。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0127"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-08T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:38Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Cisco RV132W 固件至 1.0.6.7 或更高版本，Cisco RV134W 固件至 1.0.3.20 或更高版本，通过 Cisco 官网下载中心下载对应型号固件并通过 Web 管理界面升级。若暂时无法升级，建议在边界防火墙限制 Web 管理界面仅允许受信任管理 IP 访问，并修改默认管理员密码作为临时缓解措施。参考 Cisco 安全公告 cisco-sa-20180207-rv130w 及 Bug ID CSCvg92739、CSCvh60172 获取固件下载链接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-29T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102969","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040345","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180207-rv13x_2","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-0127.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-0127.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3887f9deba3194900fbfb1022d8155887325c384/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-0127.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2018-0127.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-0127-3121.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-0127-3118.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2018-0127-3120.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Cisco IOS/CVE-2018-0127.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-0127.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3ea93936438a97f1459a1dd6e83719dbfc798be2/cves/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0127.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-0127.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0017.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0001","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0125","title":"Cisco RV132W/RV134W 路由器远程命令执行漏洞","description":"Cisco RV132W ADSL2+ Wireless-N VPN 路由器和 RV134W VDSL2 Wireless-AC VPN 路由器的 Web 管理界面存在输入验证不完整漏洞（CWE-20）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现以 root 权限执行任意代码，完全控制受影响系统，或导致设备重启造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响运行固件版本 1.0.1.11 之前的所有 RV132W 和 RV134W 路由器，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），Cisco 已在固件版本 1.0.1.11 中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0125"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-02-08T07:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:29:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Cisco RV132W 和 RV134W 路由器固件升级至 1.0.1.11 版本，固件可从 Cisco.com Software Center（产品路径：Routers > Small Business Routers > Small Business RV Series Routers）下载。该漏洞已被 CISA 列入已知被利用漏洞目录（KEV），无临时缓解措施，必须升级固件彻底修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/103140","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040336","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20180207-rv13x","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0125","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0125.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0d5eda5cdae3f3a50b92fdfcae2f5983174f2a99/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0125.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2018/CVE-2018-0125","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2018/CVE-2018-0125.rules","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/04aa22fbb624898c1d0928bc3b34fb05529275cb/2018/CVE-2018-0125/README.md","https://github.com/a-dhaou-tekup/VRA/blob/3e4f21c329250c5eca327489d3fd5be9b398ce7b/data/rag_corpus/cisa_kev_notes/CVE-2018-0125.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1c367c2407e523ae413438625300667710835348/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0125.json","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/b93b72c800b93d13fcc97984485ecaf9a9b5cbc1/data/year/2018.txt","https://github.com/lucacapacci/cisa_kev/blob/c9912f011045fb46c541c894a8ebf29180b9a4d7/data_single/2018/CVE-2018-0125.csv","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2018/CVE-2018-0125.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0709","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0709.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-4878","title":"Adobe Flash Player 内存错误引用远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Adobe Flash Player存在内存错误引用（use-after-free）漏洞，源于Primetime SDK在处理媒体播放器监听器对象时产生的悬空指针。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过诱使用户打开恶意Flash内容（如嵌入ActiveX控件的恶意网页或钓鱼邮件附件），触发该漏洞并实现任意代码执行。该漏洞影响Adobe Flash Player 28.0.0.161之前的所有版本，曾被用于针对韩国目标的定向攻击及大规模恶意邮件活动中。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-4878"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-02-06T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:59:12Z","remediation":"立即将 Adobe Flash Player 升级至 28.0.0.161 或更高版本，该版本修复了 Primetime SDK 中媒体播放器监听对象处理时的悬空指针问题。若已不再使用 Flash Player，建议直接卸载以彻底消除攻击面。Windows 用户可通过控制面板 > 程序和功能卸载，macOS 用户可将 /Applications/Adobe Flash Player 移至废纸篓。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://blog.talosintelligence.com/2018/02/group-123-goes-wild.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102893","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040318","https://access.redhat.com/errata/RHSA-2018:0285","https://blog.morphisec.com/flash-exploit-cve-2018-4878-spotted-in-the-wild-massive-malspam-campaign","https://github.com/InQuest/malware-samples/tree/master/CVE-2018-4878-Adobe-Flash-DRM-UAF-0day","https://github.com/vysec/CVE-2018-4878","https://helpx.adobe.com/security/products/flash-player/apsb18-03.html","https://securingtomorrow.mcafee.com/mcafee-labs/hackers-bypassed-adobe-flash-protection-mechanism/","https://threatpost.com/adobe-flash-player-zero-day-spotted-in-the-wild/129742/","https://www.darkreading.com/threat-intelligence/adobe-flash-vulnerability-reappears-in-malicious-word-files/d/d-id/1331139","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44412/","https://www.fireeye.com/blog/threat-research/2018/02/attacks-leveraging-adobe-zero-day.html","https://www.trendmicro.com/vinfo/us/security/news/vulnerabilities-and-exploits/north-korean-hackers-allegedly-exploit-adobe-flash-player-vulnerability-cve-2018-4878-against-south-korean-targets","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/issues/196","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-4878","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/44745","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2018/CVE-2018-4878.md","https://github.com/qazbnm456/awesome-cve-poc/blob/fc862e38e03ea68cdc62618d14891a426daff1a4/CVE-2018-4878.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules/CVE-2018-4878.yar","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/b859fc75b332184195f1952ddeea761c6913ce9b/2018/CVE-2018-4878.json","https://github.com/0x0be/PEpper/blob/9dfcade04b41422b5c8457956f984cd25fe3e6d2/rules/CVE_Rules/CVE-2018-4878.yar","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2017/CVE-2017-4878.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-4878.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b3a270a001a31742516eaea5c494f365de9d3c80/2015/CVE-2015-5119.md","https://github.com/Yara-Rules/rules/blob/0f93570194a80d2f2032869055808b0ddcdfb360/cve_rules_index.yar","https://github.com/Al1ex/CSPlugins/blob/22c046ac0b10ceff7bb7a07bdba1cea4e931a71e/CVE-2018-4878.cna","https://github.com/vysecurity/CVE-2018-4878","https://github.com/mdsecactivebreach/CVE-2018-4878","https://github.com/brianwrf/CVE-2017-4878-Samples","https://github.com/SyFi/CVE-2018-4878","https://github.com/B0fH/CVE-2018-4878"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0709.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0188","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0188.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6605","title":"Joomla Zh BaiduMap 3.0.0.1 SQL注入漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Zh BaiduMap 3.0.0.1 组件存在 SQL 注入漏洞，攻击者无需身份认证即可通过 id 参数向 getPlacemarkDetails、getPlacemarkHoverText、getPathHoverText 或 getPathDetails 请求注入恶意 SQL 语句，可导致数据库信息泄露、数据篡改甚至服务器被完全控制。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，仅需发送特制 HTTP 请求即可触发，影响范围广泛。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6605"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-02-05T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:02:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Zh BaiduMap 组件至最新版本（当前为 6.22.1.1），该版本已修复 SQL 注入漏洞。通过 Joomla 后台「扩展管理→更新」功能自动检测并安装更新，或前往开发者官网 https://zhuk.cc 下载最新安装包手动覆盖安装。如无法立即升级，可在 Joomla 后台「扩展管理→插件管理」中禁用 com_zhbaidumap 组件，或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面添加规则拦截 id 参数中包含 UNION/SELECT 等 SQL 关键词的请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43974/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43974","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6605.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6605.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/0cbbfd20018b392e9b69a82c4ac1297203bfeefd/2018/CVE-2018-6605.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6605.yaml","https://github.com/shadow1ng/fscan/blob/bf036fd9b272a56d493796badcf0a269f0a83ec0/webscan/pocs/joomla-ext-zhbaidumap-cve-2018-6605-sqli.yml","https://github.com/zan8in/afrog/blob/9c47a2b9b7e12375757acdfbc179354920c87bd8/pocs/afrog-pocs/CVE/2018/CVE-2018-6605.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6605.json","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-6605/poc/xray/CVE-2018-6605.yml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/zh_baidumap_project/zh_baidumap/CVE-2018-6605.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6605.md","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/xrayFiles/joomla-ext-zhbaidumap-cve-2018-6605-sqli.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0188.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0185","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0185.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6008","title":"Joomla! Jtag Members Directory 任意文件下载漏洞","description":"Joomla! 的 Jtag Members Directory 组件 5.3.7 版本中存在任意文件下载漏洞。该漏洞源于组件对 `download_file` 参数缺乏充分的过滤与验证，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 HTTP 请求，利用目录遍历技术下载服务器上的任意文件，包括配置文件、数据库凭证等敏感信息。攻击无需任何权限或用户交互，仅需目标系统安装受影响组件即可实施。CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高，可能导致敏感信息泄露，进一步扩大攻击面。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6008"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-29T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:01:10Z","remediation":"立即卸载 Jtag Members Directory 5.3.7 组件，替换为官方维护的替代组件。如必须使用，在 Joomla! 后台扩展管理中将该组件禁用，并在 .htaccess 中添加 `RewriteCond %{QUERY_STRING} download_file= [NC]` `RewriteRule .* - [F]` 规则阻止任意文件下载请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/146137/Joomla-Jtag-Members-Directory-5.3.7-Arbitrary-File-Download.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43913/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43913","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6008.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6008.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6008.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-6008.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6008-3574.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6008-3571.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6008-3575.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2018-6008-3572.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-6008.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Joomla/CVE-2018-6008.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-6008.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0185.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0187","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0187.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6200","title":"vBulletin vBulletin 开放重定向漏洞","description":"vBulletin 3.x.x 及 4.2.x 至 4.2.5 版本的 redirector.php 文件中存在开放重定向漏洞，由于对 url 参数缺乏充分的合法性校验，远程攻击者可构造特制的恶意链接，诱使用户点击后将其重定向至任意外部站点，导致钓鱼攻击或绕过安全策略。攻击者无需身份认证，但需用户交互配合。该漏洞影响范围广泛，CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6200"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-25T04:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:01:30Z","remediation":"升级 vBulletin 至 4.2.6 或更高版本，该版本已修复 redirector.php 中 url 参数未校验跳转目标的问题。如无法升级，修改 redirector.php 添加白名单校验逻辑，仅允许跳转到本站域名，或直接禁用 redirector.php 文件（通过 .htaccess 或 Nginx 配置返回 403）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cxsecurity.com/issue/WLB-2018010251","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6200.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-6200-3577.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-6200-3576.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-6200-3578.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/vBulletin/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/TPALL/Open Redirect/CVE-2018-6200.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6200.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0187.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0186","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0186.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-6184","title":"ZEIT Next.js 路径遍历漏洞","description":"ZEIT Next.js 4.2.2 及之前版本存在目录遍历漏洞，位于 /_next 请求命名空间下。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求，利用路径遍历技术突破目录限制，读取服务器上任意文件（如配置文件、源代码等），导致敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，无需用户交互，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 4.2.3 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2018-6184"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-24T10:29:01Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:01:28Z","remediation":"立即将 Next.js 升级至 4.2.3 或更高版本，执行 `npm install next@latest --save` 命令更新依赖。该版本完全向后兼容，所有用户均应升级。如使用 canary 通道，执行 `npm install next@canary --save`。若无法立即升级，可在反向代理或 WAF 层面添加规则，拦截包含 `..` 路径遍历特征的 `/_next` 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/zeit/next.js/releases/tag/4.2.3","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6184.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-6184.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-6184.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2018-6184.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/6xxx/CVE-2018-6184.json","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-6184.yaml","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/zeit/next.js/CVE-2018-6184.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-6184.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-6184.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/3eab0e512529a79daadefaadf0f05372813e7876/GHSA/data/2018/CVE-2018-6184.json","https://github.com/ossf-cve-benchmark/ossf-cve-benchmark/blob/91c59fd54b2b768c0f310bb0027d2ac59cdf74d4/CVEs/CVE-2018-6184.json","https://github.com/ossf-cve-benchmark/CVE-2018-6184"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0186.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0184","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0184.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5715","title":"SugarCRM 3.5.1 phprint.php 跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SugarCRM 3.5.1 的 phprint.php 文件存在跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞，攻击者可通过在查询字符串中构造恶意参数名（即 $key 变量）注入任意 JavaScript 代码。当管理员或其他用户访问包含恶意参数的 URL 时，脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。攻击无需身份认证，但需要用户交互（点击链接），CVSS 评分 6.1，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5715"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-16T20:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:00:38Z","remediation":"升级 SugarCRM 至 6.5.26 及以上版本，该漏洞在后续版本中已修复。如无法升级，在 phprint.php 中对 `$_GET` 的 key 参数进行 HTML 实体编码后再拼入 URL，或移除 phprint.php 中对 `$_GET` key 的直接拼接逻辑，改用白名单方式过滤参数名。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://m4k4br0.github.io/sugarcrm-xss/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43683/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/43683","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-5715.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/SugarCRM/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5715.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-5715.js","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/sugarcrm/sugarcrm/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/veo/vscan/blob/1beb10c08e377e15b7dd417be1843bb75aa8c4f0/pocs_yml/nucleiFiles/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2018/CVE-2018-5715/poc/nuclei/CVE-2018-5715.yaml","https://github.com/ionescu007/SpecuCheck","https://github.com/00052/spectre-attack-example"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0184.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0099","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0099.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0802","title":"Microsoft Office 内存损坏远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 公式编辑器（Equation Editor）在处理内存中的对象时存在远程代码执行漏洞。由于公式编辑器未能正确验证对象处理过程中的内存边界，导致存在越界写入（CWE-787）问题。攻击者可利用特制的 Office 文档，通过社会工程手段诱导用户打开恶意文件触发该漏洞，进而在目标系统上执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2007、2010、2013 及 2016 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。已有公开的利用工具（如 packager_exec_CVE-2018-0802.py）可在 GitHub 上获取，增加了被实际利用的风险。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0802"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-01-10T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:31:41Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 1 月安全更新 (KB4011651 等对应版本补丁)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新。受影响版本包括 Office 2007/2010/2013/2016，Equation Editor 组件存在内存损坏漏洞，攻击者可构造恶意 Office 文档诱导用户打开触发远程代码执行。如无法立即打补丁，可禁用 Equation Editor 组件：删除或重命名 `eqnedt32.exe`（路径 `C:\\Program Files\\Common Files\\Microsoft Shared\\EQUATION`），或通过组策略禁止 Office 从 OLE 对象启动 Equation Editor。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102347","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040153","https://0patch.blogspot.com/2018/01/the-bug-that-killed-equation-editor-how.html","https://github.com/rxwx/CVE-2018-0802","https://github.com/zldww2011/CVE-2018-0802_POC","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-0802","https://research.checkpoint.com/another-office-equation-rce-vulnerability/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0802","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0802.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/d08f837f771e6cd83ec9c845b0c4f72f125cbe84/2018/CVE-2018-0802.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-0802.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5f10816d455ad0d7b2a1abab6159b8d8e7afc3c8/2018/0xxx/CVE-2018-0802.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-11228.md","https://github.com/SecWiki/office-exploits/blob/54322c15acdd4b837e65061308ad7d3838edba24/CVE-2018-0802/packager_exec_CVE-2018-0802.py","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0802.md","https://github.com/rxwx/CVE-2018-0802/blob/1e1da94d3cf9ec9c3a8f30b2538105cb31b05c57/packager_exec_CVE-2018-0802.py","https://github.com/SecWiki/office-exploits/blob/54322c15acdd4b837e65061308ad7d3838edba24/CVE-2018-0802/readme.md","https://github.com/blaCCkHatHacEEkr/PENTESTING-BIBLE/blob/c458e814010ae369f21cf85e6babcc91722a2650/README.md","https://github.com/Ridter/RTF_11882_0802","https://github.com/likekabin/CVE-2018-0802_CVE-2017-11882","https://github.com/Palvinder-Singh/PS_CVE2018-0802"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0099.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0088","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0088.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-0798","title":"Microsoft Office 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Office 公式编辑器（Equation Editor）在处理内存中的对象时存在内存损坏漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向用户发送特制的 Office 文档并诱导其打开来触发该漏洞，成功利用后可实现远程代码执行，获取目标系统的完全控制权。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Office 2007、2010、2013 及 2016 等多个版本，攻击无需身份认证但需要用户交互，CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危。Microsoft 已在 2018 年 1 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2018-0798"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2018-01-10T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T01:31:40Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2018 年 1 月安全更新：Office 2007 安装 KB4011654，Office 2010 安装 KB4011651，Office 2013 安装 KB4011650，Office 2016 安装 KB4011663。如无法打补丁，可禁用 Equation Editor 组件（通过重命名 eqnedt32.exe）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-28T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/102370","http://www.securitytracker.com/id/1040153","https://0patch.blogspot.com/2018/01/bringing-abandoned-equation-editor-back.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2018-0798","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2018-0798","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/be44b05b9428dc18bc0705cf60dd8d8640cd49b1/2018/CVE-2018-0798.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/b6e8cb5bd39fed494b7be90b0ffddcadd3893758/2018/CVE-2018-0798.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/bed70a0a2e2dec8bd34bd440f68f32280391094f/2018/CVE-2018-0798.json","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/CVE-2018-0798 漏洞研究.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/4284f6963ad44b6747121c735d36bdcd1745ea43/2018/CVE-2018-0798.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2018/CVE-2018-0798.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2018/CVE-2018-0798.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6550296d9cb5b12971003dddc7912cdc0707af50/SSVC/data/2018/CVE-2018-0798.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2018/CVE-2018-0798.json","https://github.com/houjingyi233/office-exploit-case-study/blob/09de49e31b83b4348c9e892bfde1ef1f597bc38a/CVE-2017-11882&CVE-2018-0802&CVE-2018-0798/README.md","https://github.com/Sunqiz/CVE-2018-0798-reproduction"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2018-0183","file_name":"2018/AVE-2018-0183.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2018-5316","title":"WordPress SagePay Server Gateway for WooCommerce 插件跨站脚本漏洞","description":"SagePay Server Gateway for WooCommerce WordPress 插件 1.0.9 之前版本中的 includes/pages/redirect.php 页面存在反射型跨站脚本(XSS)漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可通过构造恶意的 page 参数注入任意 JavaScript 代码，当管理员或其他用户访问特制链接时，恶意脚本将在浏览器中执行，导致敏感信息泄露、会话劫持或钓鱼攻击。该漏洞利用条件简单，仅需诱使用户点击恶意链接即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.1,"aliases":["CVE-2018-5316"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2018-01-09T22:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:00:07Z","remediation":"立即将 SagePay Server Gateway for WooCommerce 插件升级至 1.0.9 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在 WordPress 管理后台禁用该插件，或通过 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）规则拦截包含恶意 page 参数的请求以缓解 XSS 风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://packetstormsecurity.com/files/145459/WordPress-Sagepay-Server-Gateway-For-WooCommerce-1.0.7-XSS.html","https://wordpress.org/plugins/sagepay-server-gateway-for-woocommerce/#developers","https://wordpress.org/support/topic/sagepay-server-gateway-for-woocommerce-1-0-7-cross-site-scripting/#post-9792337","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7ade3449b58b8e2c679712dc3af64bbd8e638364/2018/CVE-2018-5316.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2018/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5316-3568.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2018-5316-3570.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2018-5316.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a14f4e66db68a75a9270d6c9081e9ffb7f931cd8/cves/2018/5xxx/CVE-2018-5316.json","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2018-5316.js"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2018/AVE-2018-0183.toml"}]